# The Citizen South Africa

> The Citizen is an independent South African news publisher with a history dating back to 1976.
> Its digital newsroom provides trusted, timely coverage of breaking news, politics, sport, business, entertainment, lifestyle, and community affairs across South Africa, with a strong focus on news that matters to local communities.

